{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂乳、酪、粳米食，或云大麥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云壇地也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若用日初\n出時，當作四方壇。若以月夜盛時，當作滿月形"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云沈水\n香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若心不相應者，當想一切餓鬼如己所愛父、妻、子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云白芥\n子"}
